      "description": "The Tool nodes of the FHIR IG pipeline, one directory per Tool, each naming the script it invokes: the FSH dependency cone and the FHIR package cache and mirror; the IG AST (export, list, validity, plan, incremental build, diff, render, refresh, JSON-LD, pages); the IG sites and their data, pages, menu, releases and terminology index; the JSON Schema and JSON-LD surfaces; Questionnaire checks; the binary audit; and the two `Library` strippers. None is DAK-shaped: the strippers, for example, serve any IG depending on `hl7.fhir.uv.cql`, which produces oversized `Library` resources.",
